# CodeAlpha Task 1 - Web Scraping

## Objective
Collect book information from a public website using Python web scraping.

## Website
Books to Scrape: https://books.toscrape.com/

## Tools Used
- Python
- Requests
- BeautifulSoup
- Pandas

## Data Collected
- Book Title
- Price
- Rating
- Availability

## Output
The scraped data is saved in `books_data.csv`.

## How to Run

```bash
pip install requests beautifulsoup4 pandas
python web_scraping.py
